          "text": "Noctua lists \"Socket compatibility LGA1700, LGA1851, LGA1954\" (\"LOW PROFILE COOLER FOR INTEL LGA1851/1700\"); LGA1954 is not a catalogue socket. Its CPU compatibility list marks AMD AM5 and AM4 CPUs \"incompatible\"; the page's variant selector points to separate AM4 and AM5 models."
